From 376818ee412c74fd8fa30e8a5379b2cee5f5d034 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@lmepisowifi.local>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 00:12:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Sync from tmwim2-2050-g40 (added 1 feature, fixed 3 bugs,
 wifi rates export/import)

Continues this branch's earlier sync commit forward to M2's current
main (v1.5.39) - one new substantive commit since the last sync point
(510ce70/v1.5.38):

  - www2/hotspot-rates.html: Export/Import buttons for the WiFi Rates
    list (download as a .txt file, or pick one to replace the current
    rows - Save Rates still required afterward to actually apply it).
  - hotspot/index.html: a coin dropped while the fresh post-coin
    "remaining" value happened to already be within 2s of the local
    countdown's current value used to slip past the resync check, so
    the on-screen timer just kept counting down as if the coin had no
    effect; also a force-close watchdog on Done so a customer can't get
    stuck on "Finishing up." forever if the server never answers.
  - www2/hotspot-sessions.html: the admin sessions table's 10s
    auto-refresh now updates rows in place instead of tearing down and
    rebuilding the whole table every tick, which used to reset
    whoever's scroll position and cause a visible flicker.
  - www2/index.html: disk-space display now shows used/free instead of
    used/total (this branch's own LAN 3/4 port-status rows, absent from
    M2's 2-port version, are untouched - the disk-text fix was applied
    by hand at the same call site rather than copied wholesale, since a
    blind file copy would have dropped those two rows).

License-header repo URL adjusted in each copied-over file, same as the
prior sync commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
